        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/a/5/a562883d822084c5084f13f384e3fe4e27d63960.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/nB3SZ6D030vUroIn3aHRiK8DfQ4.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/a/5/a562883d822084c5084f13f384e3fe4e27d63960_2_690x191.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nB3SZ6D030vUroIn3aHRiK8DfQ4\" width=\"690\" height=\"191\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/a/5/a562883d822084c5084f13f384e3fe4e27d63960_2_690x191.png, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/a/5/a562883d822084c5084f13f384e3fe4e27d63960.png 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/a/5/a562883d822084c5084f13f384e3fe4e27d63960.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"371A2F\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">798×222 51.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nI am trying to update the variable value but it is not happening.<br>\nTeachers, How to resolve this ??</p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/atulps\">@AtulPS</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/hemalatha\">@hemalatha</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/afnan_pod\">@Afnan_POD</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sayan\">@sayan</a></p>",
